{"2643540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Age Twisters", "steam_appid": 2643540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>”Some secrets can only be solved together.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Age Twisters, a grandfather and a granddaughter embark on a journey to find her mother, who disappeared years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/1c2fbe2a24bf44053d063d49d9b3b9b1.poster.avif?t=1787680853\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/1c2fbe2a24bf44053d063d49d9b3b9b1.webm?t=1787680853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/1c2fbe2a24bf44053d063d49d9b3b9b1.mp4?t=1787680853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Use the Age Twisters to change the age of your characters.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a package arrives — the last gift left behind by their mother. Inside are the Age Twisters, bracelets that freely change the wearer’s age. Shifting in real time between childhood, adolescence, adulthood, and old age. Different ages come with unique skills that can be combined to overcome hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/fb7b3ef0d674a58a554023f69610e2e2.poster.avif?t=1787680853\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/fb7b3ef0d674a58a554023f69610e2e2.webm?t=1787680853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/fb7b3ef0d674a58a554023f69610e2e2.mp4?t=1787680853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Alone, you’re only half. Co-op awaits — where each of you make the other whole.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‘Age Twisters’ is a co-op title designed from start to finish for two players. Communicate and sync with the friend, partner, or family member you trust most. One opens the path; the other seizes the moment and pushes forward. Become each other’s eyes and ears to experience the true essence of cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/bfcc4b91666bc27f42aa094086837196.avif?t=1787680853\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras_big/bfcc4b91666bc27f42aa094086837196.avif?t=1787680853 width=1560 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Two players, one copy — local or online.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one person needs to buy the game. The other can play for free through the Friend’s Pass. Both local and online co-op are fully supported. Whether you’re side by side on the couch or miles apart, play together however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/e8d0123350ee1eeddeaca2843478ef7d.poster.avif?t=1787680853\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/e8d0123350ee1eeddeaca2843478ef7d.webm?t=1787680853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/e8d0123350ee1eeddeaca2843478ef7d.mp4?t=1787680853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;An unfolding adventure that will constantly surprise you.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow palm trees in a jungle, drive to beat Holobikes in a desert chase, dance to infiltrate into a goon’s base, teleport chickens in a factory, disguise as a suitcase, ride an animatronic T-Rex, share a flashlight inside a dark spider nest, turn your enemies into babies and much much more. Age Twister is a thrilling adventure with constant gameplay tweaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/a3a15c527489b3796c21b85ba4d1fe45.avif?t=1787680853\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras_big/a3a15c527489b3796c21b85ba4d1fe45.avif?t=1787680853 width=1560 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“The journey is being prepared. Start looking for your partner now.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to your Wishlist and hit Follow today! Be the first to hear news about this very special adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>”Some secrets can only be solved together.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Age Twisters, a grandfather and a granddaughter embark on a journey to find her mother, who disappeared years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline post