mber you trust most. One opens the path; the other seizes the moment and pushes forward. Become each other’s eyes and ears to experience the true essence of cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/bfcc4b91666bc27f42aa094086837196.avif?t=1787680853\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras_big/bfcc4b91666bc27f42aa094086837196.avif?t=1787680853 width=1560 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Two players, one copy — local or online.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one person needs to buy the game. The other can play for free through the Friend’s Pass. Both local and online co-op are fully supported. Whether you’re side by side on the couch or miles apart, play together however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/e8d0123350ee1eeddeaca2843478ef7d.poster.avif?t=1787680853\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/e8d0123350ee1eeddeaca2843478ef7d.webm?t=1787680853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/e8d0123350ee1eeddeaca2843478ef7d.mp4?t=1787680853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;An unfolding adventure that will constantly surprise you.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow palm trees in a jungle, drive to beat Holobikes in a desert chase, dance to infiltrate into a goon’s base, teleport chickens in a factory, disguise as a suitcase, ride an animatronic T-Rex, share a flashlight inside a dark spider nest, turn your enemies into babies and much much more. Age Twister is a thrilling adventure with constant gameplay tweaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras/a3a15c527489b3796c21b85ba4d1fe45.avif?t=1787680853\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/extras_big/a3a15c527489b3796c21b85ba4d1fe45.avif?t=1787680853 width=1560 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“The journey is being prepared. Start looking for your partner now.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to your Wishlist and hit Follow today! Be the first to hear news about this very special adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Age Twisters is a 2-player co-op narrative adventure game that allows you to send a free invite to friends via the Friend’s Pass. Play as a grandfather and granddaughter to solve puzzles by freely changing your age and reveal the dark secrets hidden beneath a facade of lies.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/f3ea463e77355d127dcf16d838e3e2fdb8d37a51/header.jpg?t=1787680853", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/af236784b099521b2b03be83c4756f8f5b1b66df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787680853", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643540/af236784b099521b2b03be83c4756f8f5b1b66df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787680853", "website": "https://agetwisters.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul